                                "sense_id": "f5153163-70ed-33c9-b687-51b3a9d9f377",
                                "text": "...I doubt not but you will adiuvate suche poore adnichilate orphans as whilom were condisciples with you, and of antique family in Lincolnshire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7fb683b-f596-473e-9991-d5aebe5d44f1",
                                "sense_id": "f5153163-70ed-33c9-b687-51b3a9d9f377",
                                "text": "For this reason we make known this unto you as friends and Allies in Europa, to the end that you not at all in the least manner with assist this Heathens against us being a Christian Nation, but rather adjuvate us to forward our rightious weapons against this unhuman people."
                            }
                        ]
